# M6.2a — daily rollups per org, event, day (org time zone), metric and currency.
# Fed by the Events API from the `analytics.warehouse` subscriber; every write of an event appends
# all its rows under one new `version` plus a `__snapshot` marker row. Pipes read the newest
# version of each event only. Every row carries `org_id`.

SCHEMA >
    `org_id` String `json:$.org_id`,
    `event_id` String `json:$.event_id`,
    `version` UInt64 `json:$.version`,
    `day` Date `json:$.day`,
    `metric` LowCardinality(String) `json:$.metric`,
    `currency` LowCardinality(String) `json:$.currency`,
    `value` Int64 `json:$.value`

ENGINE "ReplacingMergeTree"
ENGINE_PARTITION_KEY "toYYYYMM(day)"
ENGINE_SORTING_KEY "org_id, event_id, day, metric, currency, version"
ENGINE_VER "version"
